---
title: Fast Time Server
endpoints:
  - name: Fast Time Server
    url: http://localhost:30801
    note: MCP at /
---
Tools     get_system_time, convert_time
Auth      disabled; recreate with --set authToken=<token> to require a bearer

Health    GET /health

  curl -s http://localhost:30801/ \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \
    -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-03-26","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"gck","version":"1.0"}}}'
